WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,400
My body is covered in blood. There may be a source of infection.

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,800
Sister Wang, leave me alone. I'll stay by myself first.

3
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:11,410
Peipeipei is talking nonsense. Who said that it is 100% possible to be infected?

4
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:13,210
It's all stained on our bodies to some extent.

5
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:15,010
If something goes wrong, no one can escape

6
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:21,540
You said you said something that made me sad

7
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:33,550
Don't cry, let me do it

8
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:44,830
Handled the security of disease outbreaks

9
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:50,370
Fortunately, the remaining people were not infected
